OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,6,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,7,     FDonald Macleod meets the friends
OL,8,     F(and foes) of composer Clara
OL,9,     FSchumann. Today, we hear how her
OL,10,     Fhusband Robert was entranced from
OL,11,     Fthe moment he first heard her
OL,12,     Fplay.
OL,13,G1700 In Tune
OL,14,     FCharles Owen and Katya Apekisheva
OL,15,     Fon the London piano festival.
OL,16,     FJames Baillieu on his appointment
OL,17,     Fas Artistic Director of the Two
OL,18,     FMoors Festival from 2028.
OL,19,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,20,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,22,     Ffavourites.
