OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe celebrated Italian pianist
OL,7,     FBeatrice Rana performs works by
OL,8,     FDebussy, Prokofiev and Tchaikovsky
OL,9,     Fin a recital from the Sala
OL,10,     FSinopoli in Rome.
OL,11,G2145 The Essay: Solo
OL,12,     FFive musicians offer an intimate,
OL,13,     Fsoloist's-eye-view of some of
OL,14,     Fclassical music's masterpieces.
OL,15,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,16,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,17,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,18,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,19,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,20,     Feverything in between.
